{"speciesId":560,"names":{"fr":"Baggaïd","es":"Scrafty","en":"Scrafty","ja":"ズルズキン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils se regroupent pour rosser ceux qui pénètrent sur leur territoire. Ils crachent un venin corrosif."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Groups of them beat up anything that enters their territory. Each can spit acidic liquid from its mouth."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La plus grande crête détermine le meneur du groupe. Il détruit des blocs de béton à coups de pied."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son baggy de peau le protège quand il donne des coups de pied. Les meneurs sont ceux qui ont la plus grande crête."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se protege de los ataques con la muda de su piel mientras reparte patadas. Cuanto mayor es su cresta, más se le respeta."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"脱皮した 皮を ずりあげて ダメージを 減らしつつ キック！ とさかが 大きいほど 偉そうだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La plus grande crête détermine le meneur du groupe. Il détruit des blocs de béton à coups de pied."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El líder del grupo es aquel cuya cresta es mayor. Es capaz de romper bloques de cemento con sus potentes patadas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"トサカの 大きさで グループの リーダーを 決める。キック攻撃で コンクリートブロックを 破壊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son baggy de peau le protège quand il donne des coups de pied. Les meneurs sont ceux qui ont la plus grande crête."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se protege de los ataques con la muda de su piel mientras reparte patadas. Cuanto mayor es su cresta, más se le respeta."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"脱皮した 皮を ずりあげて ダメージを 減らしつつ キック！ とさかが 大きいほど 偉そうだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La plus grande crête détermine le meneur du groupe. Il détruit des blocs de béton à coups de pied."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El líder del grupo es aquel cuya cresta es mayor. Es capaz de romper bloques de cemento con sus potentes patadas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"トサカの 大きさで グループの リーダーを 決める。キック攻撃で コンクリートブロックを 破壊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses airs de gros dur cachent en fait un grand cœur dévoué à sa famille, sa bande et son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A pesar de su apariencia chulesca, se preocupa mucho por los miembros de su familia, el resto del grupo y su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon may be rude, but it takes very good care of its family, its friends, and its turf."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"粗暴だが 自分の 家族や 群れの仲間や 縄張りを とっても 大切にしている ポケモンなのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il provoque ses ennemis en crachant. Il passe toute sa vie sans s’aventurer hors des frontières bien définies de son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Provoca a su rival escupiéndole. No se aventura fuera de su propio territorio, donde pasa toda la vida."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It taunts its opponents by spitting. It has a certain territory that it never leaves its whole life long."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"唾を 吐いて 相手を 挑発。 決まった 縄張りを もっており 一生 そこを 離れず 過ごす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son coup de pied nonchalant possède une force de destruction si grande qu’il peut briser les piliers en béton de Bétochef."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Las patadas que propina con aparente desgana poseen una fuerza capaz de destrozar incluso los pilares de hormigón que llevan los Conkeldurr."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"As halfhearted as this Pokémon’s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr’s concrete pillars."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"やる気の なさげな キックは ローブシンの もつ コンクリートも 砕くほどの 破壊力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est de nature violente, mais au fond de lui, il tient à sa famille, à ses amis et à son territoire."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"A pesar de su carácter agresivo, se muestra muy protector con sus allegados y su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"とても 荒っぽい 性格だが 家族や 仲間や 縄張りは 大切にする ところがある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":560,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",